{"detail": {"templateUuid": "de221d01a6344cbf8ef375a1634708e5", "projectUuid": "b77c5f700c4c48c88a6768c1020cf033", "name": "《越界玩家   Crossline》", "description": "《越界玩家 Crossline》\n像一脚踩进了一张还没定稿的世界里。\n边界在这里不是拿来遵守的，更像是一层随时会被撕开的纸，往前一步，画面就开始翻面，空间开始错位，新的秩序也跟着长出来。轻的、飘的、炸开的、失重的，所有东西都在不断破开，又不断重组。\n\nCrossline 这个名字对我来说，也像一种很直接的状态。不是非要等一切都准备好了才开始，而是先喜欢，先闯进去，先把那条线跨过去。另一边是什么，其实没那么重要，重要的是你已经动身了。", "coverUrl": "/assets/afc079e925b30a68.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/e0f36951510b4b3e82f2f3a8896ee72c/e4238fdd3533c68f7c5a0e47f57c906eb1a11a1e.mp4", "snapshotId": 5815, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 762715, "ownerUuid": "e0f36951510b4b3e82f2f3a8896ee72c", "avatar": "/assets/893f91376d89ce2f.webp", "nickname": "阿浪Alang", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 92, "tags": [{"id": 3021, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "AI影像狂飙季", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3021/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 3023, "code": "test", "tagLabel": "创意单元", "parentTag": 3021, "categoryId": 0, "path": "3021/3023", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 10, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 5}, {"id": 1204, "code": "mv", "tagLabel": "MV", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1204/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 4, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verifyLevel": 2}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "🚫《越界玩家 Crossline》 MV 第一次完整用一套AIGC工... http://xhslink.com/o/1V2jeQXROzl  保留这段，去【小红书】逛逛吧~", "createAt": "2026年04月17日 13:14", "updateAt": "2026年05月09日 15:49", "publishAt": "2026年04月17日 13:14", "honors": ["创意单元-最佳创意"], "awardedTag": ["创意单元-最佳创意"], "playCount": 34, "viewCreationProcessCount": 9, "copyCanvasCount": 5, "shareCount": 0, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/de221d01a6344cbf8ef375a1634708e5.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"nodes": 369, "edges": 171